Package: openssh-server
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, openssh-client (= ${binary:Version}), openssh-sftp-server (= ${binary:Version}), adduser, libpam-runtime, libpam-modules
Provides: ssh-server
Description: OpenSSH portable server for Ubuntu 22.04
 Preserves existing configuration and host keys. Installation and upgrade do
 not start or restart SSH; administrators activate the new daemon explicitly.

